WEBVTT

00:00:00.752 --> 00:00:08.952
Welcome to the Congo Capoeira Calendar: every roda, workshop, batizado and festival of Formando Congo, together in one app.

00:00:09.352 --> 00:00:16.342
Tap an event to see the date, the place and the full programme. Descriptions in another language are translated for you automatically.

00:00:16.743 --> 00:00:22.723
Going? Tap I'm going. The event lights up in orange everywhere in the app, so you never forget it.

00:00:23.124 --> 00:00:30.534
When an organiser drives, you see the free seats and where the car leaves from. Reserve your seat: first come, first served.

00:00:30.935 --> 00:00:36.285
In the Agenda you browse everything as a list, a month or a whole year, and filter by type of event.

00:00:36.687 --> 00:00:40.697
Analytics shows how many events there were, and every city on the map.

00:00:41.098 --> 00:00:46.288
In Settings you add your capoeira name, and choose your language and light or dark mode.

00:00:46.689 --> 00:00:54.929
Need help? The How to tab explains everything. Ask Formando Congo for an invite, sign in with Google, and see you at the roda!

